WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.625
S T C, live: the receipt is the demo.

00:00:04.825 --> 00:00:09.550
Ingest a spec. The tree of concerns lands, with an ambiguity score.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:15.075
Compile the bundle: six hundred twenty-six bytes. Budget, passed.

00:00:16.275 --> 00:00:22.075
Three gates pass. Mutation testing fails the toy. The receipt records all of it.

00:00:23.875 --> 00:00:28.100
The judge rejects the failing receipt. Merge blocked, loudly.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:34.650
Tamper one byte.  The signature check fails. Quarantined.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.950
Every claim carries its receipt: identifier, commit, signature.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:46.500
The pipeline that catches sabotage.  Run it.
